        "### Combined Alabama Counties Heavy Metal Data Compilation\n",
        "This section loads the cleaned data from all four counties (Calhoun, Macon, Mobile, and Jefferson), standardizes and aligns their schemas, compiles them into single master Long and Wide datasets, and saves the consolidated workbook."
